      "start": 21.62,
      "end": 27.94,
      "text": "that I called the coded gaze, my term for algorithmic bias.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.588,
      "compression_ratio": 1.559
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0002",
      "start": 27.94,
      "end": 31.66,
      "text": "Algorithmic bias, like human bias, results in unfairness.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.588,
      "compression_ratio": 1.559
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0003",
      "start": 31.66,
      "end": 40.42,
      "text": "However, algorithms like viruses can spread bias on a massive scale at a rapid pace.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157,
