    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0022",
      "start": 98.45,
      "end": 100.77,
      "text": "So in the morning, if I wanted to feel powerful,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12,
