      "start": 130.77,
      "end": 134.49,
      "text": "a simple turn-taking game where partners cover their face",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0033",
      "start": 134.49,
      "end": 136.89,
      "text": "and then uncover it saying peek-a-boo.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0034",
      "start": 136.89,
      "end": 139.81,
      "text": "The problem is peek-a-boo doesn't really work",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0035",
      "start": 139.81,
      "end": 143.85,
      "text": "if I can't see you, and my robot couldn't see me.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0036",
      "start": 143.85,
      "end": 147.89,
      "text": "But I barred my roommate's face to get the project done,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0037",
      "start": 147.89,
      "end": 150.45,
      "text": "submitted the assignment, and figured, you know what?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0038",
      "start": 150.45,
      "end": 153.69,
      "text": "Somebody else will solve this problem.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0039",
      "start": 153.69,
      "end": 156.93,
      "text": "Not too long after, I was in Hong Kong",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0040",
      "start": 156.93,
      "end": 160.35,
      "text": "for an entrepreneurship competition.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041,
      "compression_ratio": 1.554
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0041",
      "start": 160.35,
      "end": 165.31,
      "text": "The organizers decided to take participants on a tour of local startups.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.154,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.599
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0042",
      "start": 165.35,
      "end": 170.07,
      "text": "One of the startups had a social robot, and they decided to do a demo.",
