      "start": 224.67,
      "end": 230.11,
      "text": "from the established norm will be harder to detect, which is what was happening to me.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.154,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.15,
      "compression_ratio": 1.533
    },
    {
      "id": "joy-buolamwini-how-i-m-fighting-bias-in-algorith-b6d15a#0062",
      "start": 230.11,
      "end": 232.63,
      "text": "But don't worry, there's some good news.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.154,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.15,
      "compression_ratio": 1.533
    },
    {
